      <div class="container">
        <div class="rt-section-header rt-section-header--center">
          <div class="rt-badge">THE RETAIL CHALLENGE</div>
          <h2 class="rt-section-title">Your Retail Business Is Complex.<br>Your Software Shouldn't Be.</h2>
          <p class="rt-section-subtitle">We replace fragmented, disconnected retail systems with a connected technology ecosystem that simplifies operations and drives growth.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="rt-challenge-grid">
          <div class="rt-challenge-card">
            <div class="rt-challenge-card__before">
              <span class="rt-challenge-tag rt-challenge-tag--problem">Challenge</span>
              <div class="rt-challenge-card__icon">
